<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-TRACY FASTEST IN NAZARETH INDY CAR PRACTICE.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-TRACY FASTEST IN NAZARETH INDY CAR PRACTICE.</headline>
<dateline>NAZARETH, Pennsylvania 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fastest times</p>
<p>in practice Friday for Sunday's CART Indy Car (tabulate under</p>
<p>place, car, time):</p>
<p>1. Paul Tracy (Canada), Penske Mercedes-Benz, 19.024 seconds</p>
<p>(189.235 mph/304.5 kph)</p>
<p>2. Patrick Carpentier (Canada), Reynard Mercedes-Benz,</p>
<p>19.301.</p>
<p>3. Al Unser, Jr. (U.S.), Penske Mercedes-Benz, 19,483</p>
<p>4. Michael Andretti (U.S.), Swift Ford, 19.663</p>
<p>5. Richie Hearn (U.S.), Lola Ford, 19.735</p>
<p>6. Scott Pruett (U.S.), Reynard Ford, 19.777</p>
<p>7. Gualter Salles (Brazil), Reynard Ford, 19.815</p>
<p>8. Mauricio Gugelmin (Brazil), Reynard Mercedes-Benz,</p>
<p>19.824</p>
<p>9. Andre Ribeiro (Brazil), Lola Honda, 19.858</p>
<p>10. Alessandro Zanardi (Italy) Reynard Honda, 20.012</p>
</text>
